              "description": "=Extract the single best business email address from the list of emails provided above.\nPrefer generic/departmental addresses (info@, contact@, jobs@, hr@, aachen@) over personal names (like firstname.lastname@).\nIf the list is empty, return an empty string.\nThe output must be a properly formatted, valid email address.",
              "required": true
            },
            {
              "name": " LinkedIn URL",
              "description": "=Extract the single best LinkedIn company page URL from the LinkedIn list provided above. It must be a company page (contains \"linkedin.com/company/\"), not a personal profile. If the list is empty or contains no company page, return an empty string."
            },
            {
              "name": "Instagram URL",
              "description": "=Extract the single best Instagram profile URL from the Instagram list provided above. Prefer the official business account matching the company name closely. If the list is empty, return an empty string."
